# Whitelist model: ignore everything, then opt paths in explicitly.
# This is deliberate. This directory holds credentials, licensed vendor data,
# a positions database and personal notes, none of which may be published, and
# a blacklist would eventually miss one.
/*

# --- published ---
!.gitignore
!.env.example
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!product/
!tests/
!.github/

# --- never published, even inside whitelisted directories ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/*.sqlite
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
